  "animation_notes": [
    "Authored key poses; runtime supplies arm travel, scan motion, throw scaling and slide/fade interpolation. Not a dense frame-by-frame cartoon.",
    "Idle/activated are holds. Scan uses authored lit cabinet. Compression swaps crouch then ball.",
    "Throw ball from world hand into screen-space around480,280; impact then slide downward while alpha fades; remove by3.6s.",
    "Screen gag does not inherit camera transforms. Draw smear separately from intact replacement.",
    "Hero left/right labels follow inspected poses rather than generated order; Sean left uses explicit mirror.",
    "All text remains live. Do not stretch transparent sprites based on individual opaque bounds."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Machine opening/hero occlusion and hand reach need composed runtime review.",
    "Hero emergence has one authored stepping pose, not a walk cycle.",
    "Small source edge fringes may remain; alpha compositing required.",
    "Sequence timing and world/screen transition not tested in running game.",
    "No claim of production visual approval."
  ],
  "glass_front_notes": [
    "Base cabinet replaces all four old machine state pictures, preserving hand and hero animation fields.",
    "Do not draw old foreground trim; use new trim only during emergence.",
    "Anchor96,192 and origin unchanged; hero_exit_feet82,166 unchanged. Lower opening clip revised to actual lower hatch.",
    "No runtime use of marketing composites. Sleeping clones are game sprites.",
    "Render glass after occupants and before foreground action. Glass pane interiors alpha0, reflections remain near edges."
  ],
